WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.049 --> 00:00:10.608
The shadows walk out of the thick trees.

2
00:00:10.609 --> 00:00:15.511
Pip gulps as they stand around the kids.

3
00:00:15.512 --> 00:00:20.405
A tall, thin man steps out.

4
00:00:20.406 --> 00:00:42.416
"The duke!" Jane thinks. "Stay calm."

5
00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:45.961
"It's them!" the man shouts.

6
00:00:45.962 --> 00:00:55.014
"Hooray!" Loud cries ring out.

7
00:00:55.015 --> 00:01:00.727
"We won't let you win, Duke," Jane says.

8
00:01:00.728 --> 00:01:05.117
The man pauses.

9
00:01:05.118 --> 00:01:12.533
Then he slaps his knee. "Ha-ha! Duke?

10
00:01:12.534 --> 00:01:17.642
I'm not the duke! I'm Tall Paul.

11
00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:22.088
I lead the queen's Gummy Guards."

12
00:01:22.089 --> 00:01:31.031
Pip gasps. "The Gummy Guards?"

13
00:01:31.032 --> 00:01:37.139
Paul rubs his jaw. "Where is June?"

14
00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:45.250
Jane frowns. "June got caught by the duke."

15
00:01:45.251 --> 00:01:51.005
"That's awful," Paul says. "It's not safe here.

16
00:01:51.006 --> 00:02:00.047
We will take you to Gummy Grove."

17
00:02:00.048 --> 00:02:08.696
The kids leave the woods with Paul.

18
00:02:08.697 --> 00:02:13.841
Guards watch for monsters.

19
00:02:13.842 --> 00:02:18.488
"We're glad we found you," Paul says.

20
00:02:18.489 --> 00:02:22.188
"You can stop the duke."

21
00:02:22.189 --> 00:02:26.245
"We have June's wand," Pip says.

22
00:02:26.246 --> 00:02:28.529
"Maybe it will help."

23
00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:36.436
Jane sighs. "It worked only one time.

24
00:02:36.437 --> 00:02:41.879
Can we save Sweet Land without June?"

25
00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:46.958
Paul nods. "That's why you're here.

26
00:02:46.959 --> 00:02:53.625
You're the only ones left who can."

